WEBVTT

00:06:59.363 --> 00:07:00.944
proposed an experiment.

00:07:01.564 --> 00:07:03.196
Since every patient is different,

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.634
and we don't quite know
exactly what they'll need,

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:08.345
why don't we just leave it
to the nurses to decide?

00:07:09.267 --> 00:07:10.637
Sound reckless?

00:07:10.661 --> 00:07:12.056
(Laughter)

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:14.200
(Applause)

00:07:14.224 --> 00:07:18.358
In his experiment, Jos found
the patients got better

00:07:18.382 --> 00:07:20.911
in half the time,

00:07:20.935 --> 00:07:24.614
and costs fell by 30 percent.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:30.132
When I asked Jos what had surprised him
about his experiment,